body+='<section class="section"><div class="wrap">'+heading('Manufacturing control','Quality is part of the order.','100% manual inspection, every piece, supported by checks at the line.')+'<div class="quality-controls"><article><span>01 / INCOMING</span><h3>Material release</h3><p>Grade, thickness and surface are checked before forming.</p></article><article><span>02 / IN PROCESS</span><h3>Product consistency</h3><p>Dimensions, weld points, edges and finish are reviewed at the line.</p></article><article><span>03 / PRE-SHIPMENT</span><h3>Order readiness</h3><p>Product weight, carton dimensions, gross weight, leakage and freezer performance can be checked in the dedicated inspection area.</p></article></div><div class="split-feature"><div>'+image('assets/factory-source/inspection.jpg','Inspection equipment inside the LAOTESI factory')+'</div><div><h2>Arrange your pre-shipment review.</h2><p>Customers are welcome to arrange an inspection before shipment. Factory inspection photos and videos can also be provided.</p>'+link('buyer-questions.html#faq-inspection','Inspection questions')+'</div></div></div></section>'
