body=intro('Company','Manufacturing expertise.<br><em>A human commitment.</em>','We make stainless steel kitchenware for everyday life — and help brands make it their own. Our story began in 1985 in Caitang, Chaozhou, one of China’s established stainless steel manufacturing centers.')
body+='<section class="company-panorama wrap">'+image('assets/factory-source/facility-exterior.jpg','Panoramic view of the LAOTESI factory complex in Caitang, Chaozhou','',True)+'<p>Chaozhou Laotesi Enterprise Co., Ltd. · Caitang, Chaozhou · China</p>'+facts()+'</section>'
body+='<section class="section"><div class="wrap compact-columns"><div><span class="eyebrow">From a family workshop</span><h2>To your manufacturing partner.</h2></div><div><p>Chaozhou Laotesi Enterprise Co., Ltd. brings together development, design, manufacturing and international trade. Over decades of growth, a family workshop has become a standardized, large-scale kitchenware business, with products exported to more than 100 countries and regions, including the United States, Germany, Japan and South Korea.</p><p>Our range includes stainless steel food storage containers, cookware, kettles, basins, bowls and cups. By connecting practical design with material and manufacturing expertise, we create products that make daily cooking, serving and storage easier.</p>'+link('manufacturing.html','Step inside the factory')+'</div></div></section>'
body+='<section class="section surface-soft"><div class="wrap">'+heading('Enterprise honors','Recognition built over decades.','Product quality, innovation, manufacturing, exports and contribution to the community.')+'<div class="honors-layout">'+image('assets/about/honors-community.webp','LAOTESI enterprise honors and community recognition')+'<ul class="honors-list">'+''.join('<li>'+e(h)+'</li>' for h in HONORS)+'</ul></div></div></section>'
body+='<section class="section"><div class="wrap">'+heading('Responsibility / CSR & SSR','The people behind the products.','Supporting the community around us. Caring for our team.')+'<div class="responsibility-grid"><article><span class="eyebrow">CSR / Our community</span><h3>Growing together.<br>Giving back.</h3><p>LAOTESI supports education, care for older people, poverty relief and disaster-relief initiatives. School donations and support for families and children in need are practical ways we give back to the community that has grown with us.</p><p>Our commitment also extends to rural revitalization, local transport and infrastructure projects, helping improve shared facilities and everyday life in our hometown.</p></article><article>'+image('assets/about/people-at-work-archive.webp','LAOTESI team working in the production workshop')+'<span class="eyebrow">SSR / Our people</span><h3>Air-conditioned production workshops</h3><p>We have installed air conditioning in our production workshops to make summer working conditions more comfortable for our employees. Caring for our team starts with the places where they work every day.</p></article></div></div></section>'+cta()
page('company.html','About LAOTESI — Chaozhou Kitchenware Manufacturer','Learn about Chaozhou Laotesi Enterprise Co., Ltd., manufacturing roots since 1985, export experience, enterprise honors and community responsibility.',body,'company.html')
